{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abandoned planet for millennia. You, a humanoid from the future, have a mission: dig, find relics, and solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth strange objects and artifacts left by humans. Each excavation is an opportunity to discover something useful or bizarre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/82f1a468924ce40e27a04ebf49878b03.poster.avif?t=1761260605\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/82f1a468924ce40e27a04ebf49878b03.webm?t=1761260605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/82f1a468924ce40e27a04ebf49878b03.mp4?t=1761260605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Relics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover items that seem to have come out of a science fiction movie, accompanied by curious descriptions. Why is a gas mask called a &quot;flatulence protection device&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/ef8206238fef155c628ec1d78b7cb9c6.poster.avif?t=1761260605\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/ef8206238fef155c628ec1d78b7cb9c6.webm?t=1761260605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/ef8206238fef155c628ec1d78b7cb9c6.mp4?t=1761260605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face challenges that require reasoning and creativity. Each solved puzzle brings more fun and new relics. You don't need to be an archaeologist to unravel the mysteries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/11334320d5f52ec38a31efabc8f0eb17.poster.avif?t=1761260605\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/11334320d5f52ec38a31efabc8f0eb17.webm?t=1761260605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/11334320d5f52ec38a31efabc8f0eb17.mp4?t=1761260605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn into Fuel:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert these strange objects into fuel for your ship and prepare to leave this forgotten planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/971cf04fbcd2c45c5f7b9a4a432f4609.poster.avif?t=1761260605\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/971cf04fbcd2c45c5f7b9a4a432f4609.webm?t=1761260605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603570/extras/971cf04fbcd2c45c5f7b9a4a432f4609.mp4?t=1761260605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, discover, solve puzzles, and laugh at the oddities of the past. An adventure where the curiosities of the past become the fuel of your future!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Everything I needed and more, much more.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommun